.TH quarters-adapter 1  "quarters-adapter " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-adapter \- Inspect or manage compiled OpenSSH invocation adapters
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-adapter\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect or manage compiled OpenSSH invocation adapters
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quarters\-adapter\-status(1)
Inspect the closed managed launcher set without changing it
.TP
quarters\-adapter\-install(1)
Install only absent managed launcher links
.TP
quarters\-adapter\-remove(1)
Remove only verified OpenSSH adapter links
.TP
quarters\-adapter\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
